      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:18be01l'
    '|b||Airlines were the standard example of free entry: a plane can fly a different route tomorrow.':
